            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Make a casting roll of 2D6. Add 1 to the roll if this unit is wholly within the **creeping overgrowth**.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Until the start of your next turn, friendly **^^Sylvaneth^^** units have **^^Ward (5+)^^** while they are wholly within 12&quot; of this unit.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic>
