            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If this unit charged this turn, this unit can move up to 2D6&quot; after that **^^Fight^^** ability has been resolved. It cannot end that move in combat.</characteristic>
