                        <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">If this unit charged this phase, pick up to 3 visible enemy units within 6&quot; of this unit to be the targets.</characteristic>
                        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a D3 for each target. On a 2+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the roll.</characteristic>
